  "markscheme": {
    "html": "<section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"a\"><p><strong>a</strong></p><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Q=\\frac{VR}{k}=\\frac{3.4\\times 10^{5}\\times 0.48}{8.99\\times 10^{9}}\"></span></p>\n<p>OR</p>\n<p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Q=18.2\"></span> «μC» ✓</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"b.i\"><p><strong>b.i</strong></p><p>electrons leave the small sphere «making it positively charged» ✓</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"b.ii\"><p><strong>b.ii</strong></p><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"k\\frac{q_{1}}{48}=k\\frac{q_{2}}{24}⇒q_{1}=2q_{2}\"></span> ✓</p>\n<p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"q_{1}+q_{2}=18\"></span> ✓</p>\n<p>so <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"q_{1}=12\"></span> «μC», <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"q_{2}=6.0\"></span> «μC» ✓</p>\n<p>Award [3] marks for a bald correct answer.</p></section>"
